+Rev0697 added a read-only persisted resume-transfer workorder queue selector. Rev0698 adds `plan_sync_session_checkpoint_resume_transfer_workorder_scheduler_pass(...)`, a bounded scheduler action planner that consumes those queue facts and classifies what a daemon should do next without mutating the checkpoint database.
 
